copying content.\\n\\n**Lessons Learned:**\\n- Some plugin skills are gated to user invocation only; an agent cannot start them. Ask the user to type the slash command.\\n- Codex quota exhaustion (reset 10:41 PM) blocks review gates \\u2014 sequence Codex re-inspection around the reset rather than retrying.\\n- Staged-but-uncommitted fixes (C-01 executable bit) are easy to lose across a session break; commit before pausing.\\n\\n**Action Items:**\\n- Pending user decisions: (1) the 7 skills off in Claude but live in Codex/Pi \\u2014 ArXiv, ISA, Science, capture-insight, library-review, pp-espn, session-miner \\u2014 recommend retiring from canonical unless `library-review` or `pp-espn` is used in Codex; (2) Task 8 Pi trial step 1 needs `sudo` \\u2014 recommend the user runs it.\\n- Gate C remaining: commit C-01, fix C-02 (lock race), fix C-03 (usage counts cover Claude only).\\n- Codex re-inspection of manifest fix `7459560` after quota reset; then Gate D; then update `docs/STATUS.md`.\\n- Commit the BLOCKED Task 8 report at `~/.claude/jobs/c59d1788/tmp/t8-pi-trial.md`.\\n- Still-open task from earlier: write the project-level skill at `~/DEV/KeystoneOS/.claude/skills/aios-audit/SKILL.md` (8-part read-only audit procedure).\\n- Handoff file: `/var/folders/gw/8qg6y2bj7rvdqzttmxfl9lx00000gn/T/handoff-2026-09-13-aios-gate-c.md`\\n- Last commits: `7459560` (claude-skills), `08bf6e8` (KeystoneOS).\\n\"}}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"uv run python hooks/session-start.py","durationMs":216},"type":"attachment","uuid":"4c2799ce-eaae-4ecb-ac2b-cb665e506c36","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:52:57.829Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-py","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/.claude/claude-memory-compiler","sessionId":"77409af1-f69e-4460-b6c0-a82a4b31385b","version":"2.1.259","gitBranch":"main"}
